<title>POLAND: Jutrzenka revises up 1996 net.</title>
<headline>Jutrzenka revises up 1996 net.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jutrzenka results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						1996	   1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    19.21   vs   12.84</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			17.26   vs   12.46</p>
<p>    net profit			    10.75   vs    7.61</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Jutrzenka SA. Earlier in its Q4 report the company showed a net profit of 10.31 million and income tax of 6.94 million zlotys. </p>
<p>    net sales			    127.91   vs   85.84</p>
<p>    costs of sales			95.66   vs   64.57</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     6.50   vs    4.85</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.23   vs    0.83</p>
<p>    financial costs			2.19   vs    1.21</p>
<p>    investment			     4.52   vs   19.94</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
